.TH NN-DIFF 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-diff \- semantic comparison of two models
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn diff
[\fIoptions\fR]
.I old
.I new
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compare graph topology, tensors, operators, and optionally numeric weights. Exit status 0 means no relevant difference; 1 means differences were found.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-weights
Numeric weight comparison.
.TP
.B \-\-atol \fIVALUE\fR
Absolute tolerance.
.TP
.B \-\-rtol \fIVALUE\fR
Relative tolerance.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 no relevant difference; 1 differences found; 2+ error.
.SH SEE ALSO
nn(1), nn-inspect(1), nn-compare(1)
